OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo brings floods, travel
OL,4,Adisruption, and power cuts for tens of
OL,5,Athousands
OL,6,
OL,7,FStorm Boelo is bringing flooding,
OL,8,Ftravel disruption, and power cuts
OL,9,Facross the UK
OL,11,FMore than 80,000 customers across Great
OL,12,FBritain were without power this morning
OL,13,F- there are also power cuts across the
OL,14,Fisland of Ireland
OL,16,FVideo from Largs, in Ayrshire, showed
OL,17,Fwater flowing through the town centre -
OL,18,Fwhile the tracks were submerged at
OL,19,FDalmarnock station in Glasgow
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
