OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo brings floods, travel
OL,4,Adisruption, and power cuts for tens of
OL,5,Athousands
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn the railways, people are being told
OL,8,Fnot to travel north of Preston - while
OL,9,Fon the East Coast, LNER advises against
OL,10,Ftravel north of Edinburgh
OL,12,FA number of flights across the Irish
OL,13,FSea have been cancelled, while many
OL,14,Fferry services are also suspended
OL,16,FAmber warnings for wind remain in place
OL,17,Facross large parts of Scotland and
OL,18,Fnorthern England, with a range of
OL,19,Fevents cancelled
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
